Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:05:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v8: Intl.Locale tag through ToStdString (1faf157db2, crbug
 585869521); cache epoch 41

[M159] sandbox fix from V8 15.9.128.34, not merged to 15.6 yet.
ApplyOptionsToTag narrowed the Utf8Value length to int32_t; a corrupted
string could make ICU write outside the sandbox. ToStdString() is bounded
by the 15.6 merge of 133ba8e4a90 that FlyWeb already carries. Adds the
mjsunit test, the same mjsunit.status line as upstream, and raises
kFlyWebCacheEpoch 40 -> 41 for the release after 3.2.2. Notes in
patches/v8/FLYWEB-SECURITY.md.

